Cell["\<\
A substrate is the graph a construction runs on. Every figure in this \
documentation is drawn on one, so an example starts with one line and no \
setup code.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"dea46c1f-f898-4f45-b184-e001c16c006f"],

Cell["The roster has five classes:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"4842af0a-ee19-48eb-8568-4f74c9aee7f3"],

